Derived files (Apache-2.0):

  data/api-metadata.json  Derived from awslabs' core/data/api_metadata.json:
                          restructured into per-service readOnly/write lists,
                          with awslabs' explicit overrides applied (for example
                          sts AssumeRole, iam CreateAccessKey and
                          sso GetRoleCredentials are classified as write) and
                          their hand-tuned custom read-only list merged in.
  src/metadata.ts         Read/write classification over that data,
                          reimplemented in TypeScript (service aliases such as
                          s3api -> s3; unknown operations are left unclassified
                          and treated as write by the caller).

Modifications by Lattice Systems LLC: the data was converted from awslabs'
format and extended as described above; the classification is used by a
standalone CLI instead of an MCP server.

